        "name": {
          "en": "Side Bend (Band)"
        },
        "instructions": {
          "en": "Secure band to an elevated object so that it is taunt at shoulder level and hold the handle in the left hand.||Bend the torso and contract the obliques while exhaling.||Return slowly to the starting position while inhaling.||Repeat for reps."
