        "name": {
          "en": "Toes To Bar"
        },
        "instructions": {
          "en": "NOTE: You can perform this with your knees bent or your legs straight, but use the latter for better core activation.||Grasp the pull up bar with a shoulder-width grip. You can perform this movement with your palms facing away from you or towards you. This is your starting position.||From the hanging position, bring both of your feet up so your toes make contact with the bar.||Lower yourself down to the starting position.||Repeat for reps."
        },
