        "name": {
          "en": "Squat Row (Band)"
        },
        "instructions": {
          "en": "Secure band to an elevated object so that it is taut at shoulder level and hold the handles in both hands. Start in a squat position.||Push from the heels and midfoot to extend legs and simultaneously pull band handles in a rowing motion while exhaling.||Return to starting position while inhaling, keeping core tight.||Repeat for reps."
