        "name": {
          "en": "Squat (Machine)"
        },
        "instructions": {
          "en": "Place feet shoulder width apart and slightly in front of the torso, and grip the handles.||While bracing your core and keeping chest up, push with the feet until the weight is supported by the shoulders. This is your starting position.||Slowly lower your body by breaking at the hips until the thighs and calves make a 90 degree angle.||When at the bottom of the movement, push through the heels and midfoot while exhaling to return to the starting position, making sure to keep your weight evenly distributed across your feet.||Repeat for reps."
        },
