        },
        "instructions": {
          "en": "Adjust the machine for the appropriate height so that your elbows are placed directly on the pads when you sit down and extend your arms overhead.||Feel the stretch in your lats and slowly lower your hands down in front of you while squeezing your lats.||Slowly return to the starting position.||Repeat for reps."
