        "instructions": {
          "en": "Hold a medicine ball over your head with both hands and stand with your feet at shoulder width. This is your starting position.||Slam the ball into the ground directly in front you with as much force as you can.||Pick up the medicine ball and bring it back up overhead.||Repeat for reps."
