          "en": "Triceps Extension (Machine)"
        },
        "instructions": {
          "en": "Adjust the machine's seat to the appropriate height and select the appropriate weight. Place your upper arms against the machine's pads while gripping the handles. This is your starting position.||Extend at the elbow and lower the weight until your arms are fully extended.||Once your arms are fully extended, hold the position for a brief moment and slowly raise your arms back to the starting position.||Repeat for reps."
        },
        "media": [
          {
