        "name": {
          "en": "Triceps Extension (Barbell)"
        },
        "instructions": {
          "en": "NOTE: This exercise can be performed while standing up or lying down on a flat bench.||Hold a barbell with both hands over head with arms fully extended.||Lower the dumbbell in a circular motion behind the head until the forearms touch the biceps.||Return to the starting position by flexing the triceps.||Repeat for reps."
